.TH SANCHALA-CURSOR-THEMES 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-cursor-themes \- Mouse cursor theme management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-cursor-themes
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Browse, install, and apply mouse cursor themes.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List installed cursor themes
.TP
.B set \fItheme\fR
Apply cursor theme
.TP
.B size \fIpixels\fR
Set cursor size
.TP
.B preview \fItheme\fR
Preview cursor theme
.TP
.B install \fIpackage\fR
Install new cursor theme
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-cursor-themes list
.TP
sanchala-cursor-themes set Breeze_Snow
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
